Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 23:23:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/21] Add interactive Behold as-enters replacements

Support single-object Behold costs on as-enters replacements, including the choice/resume path and automatic decline when unpayable. Anchors: reveal-land and shock-land replacement parsers, plus the Mox Diamond and Mimeoplasm MayCost payment/resume paths. CR 614.12a, 118.3, 701.4a. Tests: theorists_sanctum* and mox_diamond_unpayable_cost_declines_without_prompt.

Co-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
